  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="Tag1" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;On December 31, 2024, a new entity, Alpha Crude Holdings LLC, was formed as a wholly-owned subsidiary of Plains Oryx Permian Basin Pipeline LLC. See page 122 for additional information.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag2" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;On December 31, 2024, a new entity, Alpha Crude Holdings LLC ("Alpha") was formed as a wholly-owned subsidiary of Plains&amp;#160;Oryx Permian Basin Pipeline LLC ("POPBPL"). Following the formation of Alpha, POPBPL transferred certain carrier property to Alpha. Since this was a transfer of carrier property between entities that are under common control, the transfer was recorded at carrying value.&lt;/font&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
